    "/api/runner/run-all": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "runner"
        ],
        "summary": "Run All Stream",
        "description": "Combined clone → explore → run-tests pipeline with SSE streaming progress.\n\nPipeline stages:\n1. Clone   — shallow clone (depth=1) into\n             ~/.local/share/oscanner/repos/{platform}/{owner}/{repo}/{ref}/source/\n             Optionally checks out a specific SHA or tag.\n2. Explore — generates REPO_OVERVIEW.md via the configured LLM to understand\n             project structure, languages, and suggested test commands.\n3. Tests   — auto-detects test framework, sets up an isolated .venv, runs tests\n             inside a sandboxed subprocess. Produces TEST_REPORT.md with a\n             0–100 score based on pass/fail metrics.\n\nIdempotency flags:\n- skip_clone:   reuse existing clone (skip re-cloning)\n- skip_explore: reuse existing REPO_OVERVIEW.md (skip LLM exploration)\n\nTag annotation scoring (Gitee only):\n- When `tag` is provided, fetches the annotated tag message from Gitee.\n- Extracts feature descriptions from the message and checks which features\n  are exercised by the test suite (via LLM). Uncovered features reduce the\n  maximum achievable score proportionally.\n\nSSE events emitted:\n- {\"event\": \"progress\", \"data\": {\"message\": \"<msg>\"}}   — pipeline log lines\n- {\"event\": \"status\",   \"data\": {\"status\": \"completed\", \"results\": {...}}}\n- {\"event\": \"status\",   \"data\": {\"status\": \"failed\",    \"error\": \"<msg>\"}}\n\nWhat is NOT covered:\n- Private repositories (no authentication support)\n- Tag annotation fetch for GitHub (Gitee-only)\n- Parallel test execution within a single repo\n- Non-Git version control systems",
        "operationId": "run_all_stream_api_runner_run_all_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RunAllRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/runner/batch-run": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "runner"
        ],
        "summary": "Batch Run Stream",
        "description": "Run up to N repos through the clone → explore → test pipeline concurrently.\nConcurrency is capped at 3 (max_concurrency field, ignored if > 3).\n\nSSE events:\n- {\"event\": \"progress\", \"data\": {\"repo\": \"<url>\", \"message\": \"<msg>\"}}\n- {\"event\": \"repo_done\",  \"data\": {\"repo\": \"<url>\", \"status\": \"completed\"|\"failed\", ...}}\n- {\"event\": \"batch_done\", \"data\": {\"total\": N, \"succeeded\": N, \"failed\": N}}",
        "operationId": "batch_run_stream_api_runner_batch_run_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BatchRunRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
